### Login válido -> 200
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "joao", "senha": "123456" }

### Login inválido -> 401 (na 2ª falha o usuário é bloqueado)
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "maria", "senha": "errada" }

### Trocar senha (público)
PUT http://localhost:8080/trocarsenha/bianca
Content-Type: application/json

{ "atual": "123456", "nova": "nova123" }

### Cadastrar usuário (ROLE_MANUTENCAO)
POST http://localhost:8080/
Authorization: Basic manutencao manut123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "carlos", "senha": "senha123" }

### Listar usuários (ROLE_MANUTENCAO)
GET http://localhost:8080/
Authorization: Basic manutencao manut123

### Desbloquear usuário (ROLE_ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8080/unlock/maria
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### Admin tentando listar -> 403 (não tem ROLE_MANUTENCAO)
GET http://localhost:8080/
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
